    "type": "question",
    "label": "31",
    "prompt": "Show that the area of a regular $n$-sided polygon inscribed in a circle of radius $r$ is\n$$A=\\frac{r^2n}{2}\\sin\\left(\\frac{360^\\circ}{n}\\right).$$",
